<title>HONG KONG: Companion Marble in bonus warrant issue.</title>
<headline>Companion Marble in bonus warrant issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marble and granite distributor Companion Marble (Holdings) Ltd on Wednesday proposed a 1-for-5 bonus warrant issue.</p>
<p>The exercise price is HK$1.20, subject to adjustment, and the warrants expire October 10, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>Companion Marble said it would need to issue 89.80 million new shares if the warrants were exercised in full.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
